# UI enforcement (frontend)

Use **`sf-*` role classes** from `src/app.css`. Color at call site (`text-fg`, `text-fg-dim`, `text-destructive`). Extend primitives — don't copy class strings.

## Typography cheat sheet

| Element | Class |
|---------|-------|
| Page title `h1`/`h2` | `sf-headline-sm text-fg` |
| Section header | `sf-section-label text-fg-dim` |
| Body / description | `sf-body-md text-fg` or `text-fg-dim` |
| Emphasized body | `sf-body-md-strong text-fg` |
| Form `<label>` / `<legend>` | `sf-field-label` |
| Tab / button / chip | `sf-label-md text-fg` |
| Column header / badge | `sf-label-sm text-fg-dim` |
| Timestamp / duration | `sf-meta-sm text-fg-dim` |
| Hero (onboarding) | `sf-display-lg text-fg` |

**Banned:** `uppercase`, `text-base`, `text-sm`, `text-headline-lg`, `text-body-lg`, `tracking-heading`, inline `text-label-sm … uppercase` label recipes.

**Primitives:** `ConfigField`, `LabeledTextField`, `Button`, `TabPage` — fix typography there, not in screens.

Run `npm run check:ds` before finishing. Deep reference: `.cursor/skills/ui-enforcement/references/typography.md` (only if unsure).

## Color cheat sheet

| Level | Class |
|-------|-------|
| Primary text | `text-fg` |
| Secondary — captions, icons, chevrons | `text-fg-dim` |
| Recessed helper/empty copy only (not icons) | `text-fg-muted` |

**Surfaces:** `bg-canvas` (page only) → `bg-panel` → `bg-card` → `bg-fill`; borders `border-rim` / `border-fill`.

**State (meaning only):** `brand`+`on-brand` CTA · `active` selection · `destructive` danger/errors · `warning` caution · `success` confirmed.

**Banned:** `text-fg/40`–`text-fg/90`, `bg-black/50` — use semantic fg levels + `sf-scrim` / `bg-overlay`.

Recipes: `docs/color-audit.md` · `.cursor/skills/ui-enforcement/references/color.md`

## Layout & scroll cheat sheet

**Default (lists, detail, settings):** chrome stays visible; **one** body scrolls.

| Zone | Classes | Primitive |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Screen root | `h-full min-h-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden` | — |
| Chrome (title, tabs, actions, banners) | `shrink-0` — height varies with content | `PanelHeader` |
| Scroll body | `min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto` | `ScrollablePanel` |
| Footer actions (optional) | `shrink-0` | `PanelFooter` |

**Simple overview (no sticky chrome):** `h-full overflow-y-auto` on root — whole page scrolls (`dashboard`).

**Height chain:** `h-screen` shell → `flex min-h-0 flex-1` body row → `<main class="flex flex-col …">` → screen `h-full` → `ScrollablePanel`.

**Banned:** `flex-1` on screen root without flex parent · `overflow-y-auto` without `min-h-0` · multiple vertical scroll regions per pane · `sticky`/`fixed` pane chrome.

**App shell:** `<main>` must be `flex flex-col` so child screens get a bounded height.

Deep reference: inline cheat sheet above (layout-scroll chapter planned in `skills/ui-enforcement/references/`).
